<title>TAIWAN: CHINA AIRLINES HIKES '97 PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>CHINA AIRLINES HIKES '97 PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan carrier China Airlines said on Friday it had raised its 1997 pre-tax profit forecast to T$3.26 billion from an earlier forecast of T$1.78 billion.</p>
<p>It was the second time China Airlines had increased its pre-tax profit projections, a company statement said.</p>
<p>China Airlines attributed the higher profit forecast to better business and lower oil prices.</p>
<p>In January-May, China Airlines' pre-tax profits were T$1.46 billion, it said.</p>
